 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** 3D point cloud data (coordinates).
-*   **Output:** A hierarchical grid structure supporting insertion, nearest neighbor search, and point removal.
+*   **Input:** 3D point cloud data (coordinates) [S1, unofficial].
